<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1275419680"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:28.840"><div begin="26.129" end="50.884" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="26.129" end="31.290" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="26.129" end="26.704">不要</span><span begin="26.704" end="26.966">再</span><span begin="26.966" end="27.486">想</span><span begin="27.486" end="28.330">你</span> <span begin="29.507" end="30.033">不要</span><span begin="30.033" end="30.315">再</span><span begin="30.315" end="31.290">爱你</span></p><p begin="31.481" end="37.796" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="31.481" end="32.086">让时</span><span begin="32.086" end="32.641">间</span><span begin="32.641" end="32.939">悄</span><span begin="32.939" end="33.462">悄</span><span begin="33.462" end="33.737">地</span><span begin="33.737" end="34.652">飞逝</span> <span begin="34.871" end="35.416">抹去</span><span begin="35.416" end="36.439">我俩</span><span begin="36.439" end="37.132">的回</span><span begin="37.132" end="37.796">忆</span></p><p begin="38.250" end="44.441" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="38.250" end="38.797">对于</span><span begin="38.797" end="39.344">你</span><span begin="39.344" end="39.887">的</span><span begin="39.887" end="41.108">名字</span> <span begin="41.294" end="42.131">从今</span><span begin="42.131" end="43.143">不会</span><span begin="43.194" end="43.823">再提</span><span begin="43.823" end="44.441">起</span></p><p begin="44.683" end="50.884" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="44.683" end="45.418">不再让</span><span begin="45.418" end="45.945">悲</span><span begin="45.945" end="47.212">伤</span> <span begin="47.969" end="48.821">将我心</span><span begin="48.821" end="49.402">占</span><span begin="49.402" end="50.884">据</span></p></div><div begin="53.086" end="1:18.125" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="53.086" end="58.320" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="53.086" end="53.820">让它随</span><span begin="53.820" end="54.554">风</span><span begin="54.554" end="55.288">去</span> <span begin